# .gitignore for a Visual Studio / .NET 10 Worker Service project
# See https://github.com/github/gitignore for templates

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
build/
out/
artifacts/

## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml
*.DotSettings.user

## Visual Studio Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

## NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
.nuget/

## dotnet
*.dll
*.exe
*.app
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.runtimeconfig.dev.json
*.deps.json
publish/
.dotnetwatch/

## Test and coverage results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage/
coverage*.xml

## Logs
*.log

## User secrets and local config
local.settings.json
secrets.json
secrets.*
.env

## Database files
*.mdf
*.ldf

## OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Other
node_modules/
.vagrant/

## JetBrains Rider caches
/.idea/
